# Go

Follow `docs/engineering/golang.md` and `docs/engineering/testing.md`.

- Names state the role. No `Util`, `Helper`, or `Manager` packages.
- MUST NOT extract a one-off helper used in a single place.
- Wrap errors with `%w`. No `panic` for expected failures.
- I/O takes `context.Context`.
- Table-driven tests for pure logic.
- Run `golangci-lint run ./...` before claiming Go DoD.
- `vendor/` is committed (ADR-0006). Refresh with `go mod vendor` after dependency changes. Verify APIs under `vendor/`.
